# Markdown, deliberately. Prettier pads table cells to a width it computes from
# code points, and Cyrillic content comes out misaligned — the separator row
# ends up wider than the rows it separates, which is worse than the hand-written
# source. It does not manage prose width either (proseWrap stays "preserve"),
# so there is nothing left for it to do here.
